Tool response:
Tool: search_depots
Description: Lookup the internal ID of a depot by its name.
Parameters:
    {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "name": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "Name of the depot to search for",
          "title": "Name"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "name"
      ]
    }

Tool response:
Tool: get_compliance_report_vehicles
Description: Retrieve all vehicles in the specified depot that have battery levels below 25% 
and overdue maintenance schedules, including driver assignments, last service date, 
and projected downtime hours.
Parameters:
    {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "depot_id": {
          "type": "integer",
          "title": "Depot Id",
          "description": ""
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "depot_id"
      ]
    }
